  source: >-
    loom/schema/component.js — COMPONENT_SCHEMA (real, checked directly: requiredKeys
    ['id','namespace','name','version'], uuid enforced separately by the loom.uuid-present Axiom in
    driver.js, not duplicated here). emerge's own use: emerge.node-taxonomy.md marks this VIA LOOM —
